    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20119" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βληστρ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>toss about</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτὸν
			β.</span>, as a sick person on his bed, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				3.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βληστρίζοντες ἐμὴν φροντίδ᾽ ἀν᾽
					Ἑλλάδα γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Xenoph.
					8.2
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμαυτὸν πόλιν ἐκ πόλεως φέρων
					ἐβλήστριζον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					45
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βληστρίζειν ἑαυτόν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>.</div>
